  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.1",
      "source_sha256": "9ec83946670faded",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "From the elder to the beloved Gaius, whom I love in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "c23d4e689109156f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Beloved, I pray that you may prosper in all things and be healthy, just as your soul prospers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.3",
      "source_sha256": "69527164199e6774",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "I was very glad when brothers came and testified to your truth, just as you walk in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "8ba5d128c9e0fade",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "I have no greater joy than this: to hear that my children walk in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.5",
      "source_sha256": "a0163ccb2433333c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Beloved, you act faithfully in whatever you do for the brothers, including strangers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.6",
      "source_sha256": "bab655b2852a9450",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "They testified to your love before the church. You will do well to send them on their way in a manner worthy of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.7",
      "source_sha256": "bf98e9d9387780a2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "For they went out for the sake of the Name and take nothing from any of the Gentiles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.8",
      "source_sha256": "5f1229f257bfcd62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "We therefore ought to welcome such people, so that we may be fellow workers for the truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.9",
      "source_sha256": "1a90d5d58aaeae77",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "I wrote something to the church, but Diotrephes, who is foremost among them, does not receive us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.10",
      "source_sha256": "5177ad77b19f513b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "For this reason, if I come, I will call attention to the things he does: he troubles us with malicious, wordy talk. Not satisfied with this, he himself does not welcome the brothers, and he prevents those who welcome them and even expels them from the church."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.11",
      "source_sha256": "af9e7c75e02b18ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Beloved, do not imitate evil, but good, for whoever does good is from God, and whoever does evil has never seen God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.12",
      "source_sha256": "99332a2087c9b68e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "Everyone, the church, and the truth have borne witness to Demetrius. We too bear witness, and you know that our testimony is true."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.13",
      "source_sha256": "ab1463da81bb551f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "I had many things to write to you, but I do not wish to write with paper and ink,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.14",
      "source_sha256": "c840b71a18c4d041",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "for I hope to see you very soon and speak face to face."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "armenian/3john#3John.1.15",
      "source_sha256": "2831fddbf4d43534",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Peace be with you. The friends greet you. Greet our friends, each by name."
    }
  ]
}
